<Project>

  <!--
    Deliberately empty, and deliberately does NOT import the Directory.Build.props in the repo root.

    MSBuild stops walking up the moment it finds one of these, so this file is what keeps the root's
    build settings out of the tests. Those settings exist to compile against the game's own
    assemblies: net35, NoStdLib, and references resolved out of Audiosurf2_Data\Managed. Every one
    of them is wrong here. The whole point of the test project is that it needs no game, no BepInEx
    and no Unity, so it targets a normal desktop framework and uses the normal reference assemblies.

    If shared test settings are ever wanted, they go here.
  -->

</Project>
